// Lets a non-player entity (e.g. Lux's sentry gun) drive Input-consuming systems (WeaponSystem) the
// same way a real player does, without an actual PlayerLink/PlayerRef behind it - some other system
// (the entity's own "brain", e.g. a future SentryInputSystem) writes into Data every tick to express
// intent (Fire.IsDown = true when it wants to shoot, Direction, etc.), and WeaponSystem reads it
// through the exact same Input shape a real player's input uses - see WeaponSystem.TryResolveInput.
component InputSource
{
    Input Data;
}
